WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:05.080
Can God really forgive the sin I

2
00:00:05.080 --> 00:00:05.800
still remember?

3
00:00:06.720 --> 00:00:09.200
Romans four brings us David’s words about

4
00:00:09.200 --> 00:00:11.140
people whose wrongdoing is forgiven,

5
00:00:11.900 --> 00:00:12.980
whose sins are covered,

6
00:00:13.640 --> 00:00:15.220
and whose sin the Lord does not

7
00:00:15.220 --> 00:00:16.180
count against them.

8
00:00:16.900 --> 00:00:18.660
Those words face real guilt.

9
00:00:19.580 --> 00:00:22.600
Forgiveness is God’s merciful action toward people

10
00:00:22.600 --> 00:00:23.400
who trust him.

11
00:00:23.940 --> 00:00:25.640
The memory of your sin may still

12
00:00:25.640 --> 00:00:25.940
hurt.

13
00:00:26.560 --> 00:00:28.580
You can acknowledge what happened and bring

14
00:00:28.580 --> 00:00:30.060
it honestly before God.

15
00:00:30.060 --> 00:00:32.800
Then return to what he says about

16
00:00:32.800 --> 00:00:34.660
the person justified by faith.

17
00:00:35.300 --> 00:00:35.760
In Christ,

18
00:00:36.380 --> 00:00:38.640
your remembered failure is met by real

19
00:00:38.640 --> 00:00:39.240
forgiveness.

20
00:00:40.040 --> 00:00:41.180
You are invited to rest

21
00:00:41.180 --> 00:00:42.040
in his mercy,

22
00:00:42.440 --> 00:00:44.140
even while your feelings take time

23
00:00:44.140 --> 00:00:44.580
to settle.
